    <briefdescription>
<para>Cox-Ingersoll-Ross model class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the Cox-Ingersoll-Ross model defined by <formula id="296">\[ dr_t = k(\theta - r_t)dt + \sqrt{r_t}\sigma dW_t . \]</formula></para><para><xrefsect id="bug_1_bug000007"><xreftitle>Bug</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>this class was not tested enough to guarantee its functionality.</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
